ovorgas-essence-mini-world-change\">Devovorga's Essence Mini World Change</a>. Alternatively, you can trade them with NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/Malunga\">Malunga</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Liberty%20Bay\">Liberty Bay</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32347,32808,5\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32347, 32808, 5)</a>) by saying <span class=\"keyword-highlight\">Bursa Obscura</span>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>As announced on August 27, 2024, the patch added one <a href=\"#/wiki/Imbuing\">imbuement slot</a>.</li>\n<li>On September 10, 2024, the patch made it so NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/Malunga\">Malunga</a> also sells this item.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buyfrom\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Location</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Dread%20Guardian\">Dread Guardian</a></td><td>The Void</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">55 <a href=\"#/wiki/Tentacle%20Piece\">Tentacle Pieces</a></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Malunga\">Malunga</a></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Liberty%20Bay\">Liberty Bay</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">55 <a href=\"#/wiki/Tentacle%20Piece\">Tentacle Pieces</a></td>